  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this Trust fund is to support the Albania Financial Supervisory Authority in implementing selected parts of its ambitious and far reaching strategy for FY 2018-2022 by (i) strenghthening its capacities to regulate and supervise the capital markets and insurance sectors; and (ii) boosting market development for insurance and capital markets products through increased financial awareness and education, and stimulation of financial innovation</narrative>
